# Files stow must NOT symlink into ~/.config.
#
# Defining this file REPLACES stow's built-in ignore list, so the defaults worth
# keeping (VCS metadata, README/LICENSE) are repeated here.
#
# This exists because a stray .DS_Store in the repo collided with the one in
# ~/.config and made `stow -t ~/.config .` abort *entirely* -- silently leaving
# Brewfile, .editorconfig, .stylua.toml and mise/ unlinked.

# macOS cruft
\.DS_Store
\._.*

# VCS
\.git
\.gitignore
\.gitmodules

# Docs
README.*
LICENSE.*

# Tool state that belongs to the repo, not to ~/.config
\.claude
\.stow-local-ignore

# Stowed separately into $HOME, not ~/.config (see README)
zshrc
